  "details": "On Quest 2, the FOV of the cameras are not wide enough for it to track my hands in T-Pose. I can't pinch my fingers to finish calibration when they are out of range, and putting my hands forward will cause the elbows on my character to calibrate incorrectly. A suggestion would be adding a delay of a few seconds before the calibration finishes, similar to SlimeVR: you would tap calibrate, get into T-Pose, and it would confirm your calibration when the countdown finishes.",
